Tech stack: Mendix 10.24.9 Pluggable Widget, TypeScript, React 18.2, mobx-react-lite (`isolateGlobalState: true`), dhtmlxGantt, pnpm 11.8.1.
Architecture: **AxGantt JSON-driven** — `taskListJson`, `scaleJson`, `columnsJson`, `markerJson` from Mendix microflows; PM roadmap header from expressions.
Key features: 5-level project tree (left), year→week timeline (2026 = 53 weeks), Mendix action callbacks (no built-in dialogs), drag-drop, mock roadmap data.
Contracts: `contracts/widget-properties-schema.md`, `contracts/axgantt-json-schemas.md`, `contracts/pm-roadmap-header.md`, `contracts/mendix-action-context.md`.
